    "cls_id": "CS03122",
    "sub_id": "02270",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>本課程旨在教導學生解決工程或應用科學中實際問題所需之相關數學。課程內容涵蓋之單元<br />\n有一階微分方程、二階及高階之線性微分方程、微分方程之聯立方程、微分方程之級數<br />\n解、特殊函數等。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>This course introduces students to those areas of mathematics which are most important in<br />\nconnection with practical problems. Five topics are included in the course：(1)First-Order<br />\nDifferential Equations (2)Linear Differential Equations of Second and Higher Order (3)System of<br />\nDifferential Equations, Phase Plane, Qualitative Methods (4)Series Solutions of Differential<br />\nEquations, Special Functions.<br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": null
  },
